# EmojiStore: search ranking; grid y 418..694.
ipc panels open emoji TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
key smile
wait 1
shot smile
note Search "smile": the first results are the same emoji in the same order as QML (compare the grid y 418..694).
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace -k BackSpace -k BackSpace -k BackSpace -k BackSpace
key :heart:
wait 1
shot heart
note Search ":heart:": same results and order as QML.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key <3
wait 1
shot lt3
note Search "<3": same results and order as QML; literal matches first.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key wave
wait 1
shot wave
note Search "wave": waving hand first; same order as QML. First cell centre is (784, 468).
# MANUAL: pick with Enter into a text field (foot): text arrives about 200 ms after close; reopen -> it is first under "Frequently used"
# MANUAL: right-click a toned emoji (784, 468), choose a tone; reopen, search wave -> shown in that tone; footer says "Waving hand, ... skin tone" (right button not supported by ptr)
key -k Escape
